"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, October to November has come in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 35% of normal in November to December and 60% in October to November. So far in 2026 the middle came in at 57% in February to March and 61% in June to July. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1963.</p>"}
